    "title": "Drying out for Friday with brighter skies and cool temperatures - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Matt Hoffman ,\n1 days ago Tonight: We'll see showers tapering off tonight across the region. Winds will stay breezy through some higher terrain areas and along the coast. Low temperatures will fall into the upper 30s for our westside valleys with lower 30s for lows down in Siskiyou County. The Klamath Basin will see temperatures falling into the upper 20s to lower 30s. Along the coast, we'll see low temperatures in the middle 40s. Read full article\n4",
